        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-undo-to-find-the-cause-50-e68638d4-944c-44c1-899b-7bfb599853f5",
        "text": "### Undo gives you clues.\n**Undo one change at a time**, then test again.\n\nWhen the problem disappears, the change you reversed is a clue.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8caa8a03da4b57974d9a869fdc4d81f9-UH3-1-undo-to-find-the-cause.gif",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
