      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-undo-to-find-the-cause-50-1ea4fc18-b29a-41b9-921d-5d578aac815b",
        "text": "### Give AI the clue.\n**Tell AI:** “Making the banner taller covered the button. Keep the button visible.” \n\n**Test again** after AI makes the change.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1a67ceeb5dce237f0d8e9e06dc64eb19-exec-333cd2b2-b949-4239-892b-4c4b10489b78.png",
